#: themes/library/montenegro/templates/marketplace/vendor_apply.html
msgid "Tours, stays, boat trips, tastings — list them at no cost. As a founding partner you pay 0% commission during our launch period and keep 100% of what your guests pay."
msgstr "Ture, smještaj, izleti brodom, degustacije — objavite ih bez ikakvih troškova. Kao partner od početka plaćate 0% provizije tokom lansiranja i zadržavate 100% onoga što vaši gosti plate."

#: themes/library/montenegro/templates/marketplace/vendor_apply.html
msgid "We are early, and we would rather be straight with you than oversell. Here is exactly what you get today."
msgstr "Tek smo počeli i radije ćemo biti iskreni nego obećavati previše. Evo tačno šta dobijate danas."

#: themes/library/montenegro/templates/marketplace/vendor_apply.html
msgid "We do the finding"
msgstr "Mi vas pronalazimo gostima"

#: themes/library/montenegro/templates/marketplace/vendor_apply.html
msgid "What a founding partner gets"
msgstr "Šta dobija partner od početka"

#: themes/library/montenegro/templates/marketplace/vendor_apply.html
msgid "You keep 100% of every booking. No listing fee, no monthly fee, no payout fee. If we ever introduce a commission, founding partners are told well in advance and are free to leave."
msgstr "Zadržavate 100% svake rezervacije. Bez naknade za oglas, bez mjesečne naknade, bez naknade za isplatu. Ako ikada uvedemo proviziju, partneri od početka biće obaviješteni na vrijeme i slobodni su da odu."

#: themes/library/montenegro/templates/marketplace/vendor_apply.html
msgid "You stay in control"
msgstr "Vi imate kontrolu"

#: themes/library/montenegro/templates/marketplace/vendor_apply.html
msgid "Your listing gets its own page in English and Serbian, structured data for Google, and a feed built for AI assistants — so travellers asking ChatGPT what to do in Kotor can be shown your tour. That is work most small operators never get to."
msgstr "Vaš oglas dobija svoju stranicu na engleskom i srpskom, strukturirane podatke za Google i feed napravljen za AI asistente — pa putnik koji pita ChatGPT šta da radi u Kotoru može vidjeti vašu turu. To je posao do kojeg većina malih organizatora nikada ne stigne."

#: themes/library/montenegro/templates/marketplace/vendor_apply.html
msgid "Your listing, both languages"
msgstr "Vaš oglas, na oba jezika"

#: themes/library/montenegro/templates/marketplace/vendor_apply.html
msgid "Your prices, your dates, your cancellation terms. No exclusivity — keep selling on every other channel you already use. Guests contact you directly, and you can pause or remove a listing whenever you want."
msgstr "Vaše cijene, vaši datumi, vaši uslovi otkazivanja. Bez ekskluzivnosti — nastavite da prodajete na svim kanalima koje već koristite. Gosti vas kontaktiraju direktno, a oglas možete pauzirati ili ukloniti kad god poželite."

